  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to Kenya&apos;s National Examination Centre re Education Assessment Resource Centre</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">National Foundation for Educational Research will work collaboratively with the British Council and Kenya&apos;s National Education Centre in supporting the Education Assessment Resource Centre to become a fully operational and self-sustainable Assessment Resource Centre that contributes to global best practice in assessment and supports ongoing capability and capacity development to transform education outcome for all in the region and beyond.</narrative>
  </description>
